    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to present to the market this bright and spacious two-bedroom, one-bathroom ground-floor apartment, ideally situated within the well-maintained development of The View, Larch Hill, Santry.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 66 sq.m, the property offers generous and well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The layout comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, two generously sized bedrooms and a modern family bathroom.\r\nA particular feature of the property is the private decked patio area, providing valuable outdoor space ideal for relaxing or entertaining. Further features include double-glazed windows, electric heating, fitted wardrobes and resident parking. The development is complemented by well-maintained landscaped communal gardens, creating an attractive residential setting.\r\n\r\nThe View enjoys an excellent location in Santry, with a wide range of local shops, schools, restaurants and recreational amenities within easy reach. The area is well served by public transport and benefits from convenient access to the M1 and M50 motorways, Dublin Airport and Dublin City Centre.\r\nOffering generous accommodation, private outdoor space and excellent connectivity, this property should appeal to first-time buyers, investors and those seeking a well-located home within an established Santry development.\r\n\r\nService Charge: Approx. €1,500 per annum."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation comprise of:\r\n\r\nFoyer – 3.05m x 1.19m\r\nWelcoming entrance foyer with laminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving Room – 3.80m x 4.04m\r\nBright and spacious living area with laminate wood flooring, fitted blinds and classic ceiling coving.\r\n\r\nDining Area – 3.49m x 2.33m\r\nBright dining space with laminate wood flooring, fitted blinds, ceiling coving and sliding patio doors providing direct access to the decked patio area.\r\n\r\nKitchen – 2.01m x 4.04m\r\nBright open-plan kitchen with tiled flooring, a generous range of fitted wall and floor units and tiled splashback. Integrated appliances include an oven/grill, fridge/freezer, electric hob and extractor fan, with plumbing provided for a washing machine.\r\n\r\nDecked Patio – 2.17m x 3.28m (excluded)\r\nNicely presented private outdoor space finished with timber decking, ideal for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n\r\nHallway – 0.88m x 2.12m\r\nWith laminate wood flooring and ceiling coving.\r\n\r\nBedroom – 4.14m x 2.28m\r\nWell-proportioned bedroom with laminate wood flooring, fitted blinds and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom – 4.89m x 2.95m\r\nGenerously sized primary bedroom with laminate wood flooring, fitted blinds and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom – 1.70m x 1.92m\r\nFully tiled bathroom comprising a bathtub with rainfall shower head and handheld shower attachment, W.C. and W.H.B. with under-sink storage. Further features include an electric heater and wall-mounted mirrored vanity cabinet.\r\n\r\nExternally: There is parking to the front of the building and maintained gardens throughout the development."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright and spacious 2-bedroom ground-floor apartment\r\n\r\nBright open-plan kitchen/living/dining area\r\n\r\nPrivate patio area\r\n\r\nTwo generously sized bedrooms\r\n\r\nDouble-glazed windows throughout\r\n\r\nBuilt it in wardrobe on both bedrooms\r\n\r\nExcellent location with easy access to Dublin Airport, M1, M50 and Dublin City Centre"
      },
